  ["Increase <Yellow>*f**</> maximum Health, and restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=1?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=2?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=3?*f**}</> lost Health."] = "Aumente <Yellow> *f** </> Vida máxima e restaure <Yellow> {CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=1?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=2?*f**}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085021)=3?*f**} </> perdeu Saúde.",
