  ["Yes, we must leave here first. There are too many noisy spirits in the cemetery."] = "Sim, devemos sair daqui primeiro. Há muitos espíritos barulhentos no cemitério.",
  ["Yes, we are responsible for events related to the Evernight Goddess believers in Tingen. Similar organizations include the Mandated Punishers of the Storm Church and the Machinery Hivemind of the Steam and Machinery Church."] = "Sim, somos responsáveis ​​por eventos relacionados aos crentes da Deusa da Noite Eterna em Tingen. Organizações semelhantes incluem a Igreja Mandated Punishers of the Storm e a Machinery Hivemind da Steam and Machinery Church.",
  ["Yes, I live in the East District, and I come over on weekends to take care of the garden."] = "Sim, moro no Distrito Leste e venho nos finais de semana para cuidar do jardim.",
