  ["The <P_Yellow> broken wooden house </> at the entrance of the village, and the two <P_Yellow> adjacent </> straw houses, the experience is particularly good, go quickly!"] = "A <P_Yellow> casa de madeira quebrada </> na entrada da aldeia, e as duas <P_Yellow> casas de palha adjacentes </>, a experiência é particularmente boa, vá rápido!",
